            "block_content": "NOTE 2 This document does not mandate usage of a particular V2G root CA. In case multiple V2G root CAs are available in a region, it is up to the CSO's discretion (while being aware of the applicable local/regional/state/federal/international rules/regulations/laws) to decide which V2G root CA they use as the trust anchor for the SECC certificate in their SECCs.",
